  "description": "His dignity, his body, his… heart? Soohyun Ji wants to be famous, no matter the cost. Dubious salvation from an abusive sponsor comes in the form of Jaekyung Suh, a popular actor from an ultra-wealthy family. Jaekyung alternates between icy cold demands, and warm, adoring affection, leaving Soohyun’s feelings reeling. But behind his whiplash behavior, Jaekyung is hiding feelings he can’t reconcile—a long-lost love for the boy in his memories. \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
